    "Opt-in SOTC_ATTACHMENTLESS_SCISSOR: adapt shadPS4 0cd6e4f combined scissor bound to existing Apple attachmentless clamp; include extent in render-state memo key; preserve empty-scissor fallback and attachment/motion passes.",
